{"unit_id":"Semidia__dsh-sampling-sliders#card-zh","repo":"Semidia/dsh-sampling-sliders","commit":"19eb0c65bd71500233e581d034894683e4dc2528","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sampling-sliders 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的模型采样参数插件，在对话输入栏添加「采样」面板，并通过 settings 保存用户选择。面板可为 temperature 和 maxTokens 单独启用覆盖值，也可恢复跟随模型默认值；持久化模式会保留设置，热调模式在下次启动时清除。Host 在 agent/request 瀑布事件取得原始调用配置后合并这两个参数，因此作用于经过该钩子的模型请求。适合希望在 DSH 中调整回答随机性或输出长度的用户；不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/client.js:126-205","src/index.ts:27-61"]}
{"unit_id":"Semidia__dsh-sampling-sliders#card-en","repo":"Semidia/dsh-sampling-sliders","commit":"19eb0c65bd71500233e581d034894683e4dc2528","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sampling-sliders adds a sampling panel to DSH web conversations. Users can override temperature and maxTokens, restore defaults, and select temporary or persistent settings. The host applies overrides to agent/request calls, tuning randomness and output length. No extra API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["dist/client.js:126-205","src/index.ts:27-61"]}
